WEBVTT

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.470
Cuticle Detective Inaba

00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:39.230
Yuuta-kun, what's that?

00:01:39.230 --> 00:01:41.120
Valentine's Day chocolate, homemade!

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:43.390
Chocolate? Is there any for me?

00:01:43.390 --> 00:01:45.750
Yes, there is. There's white
chocolate in the bathroom.

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:48.830
Oh, I got it! It's the soap.

00:01:49.030 --> 00:01:51.230
I wonder if Sensei is back yet.

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:56.800
Meeting Room

00:01:59.380 --> 00:02:00.090
Seal

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:05.210
Are you sure you want
to give him chocolate?

00:02:05.210 --> 00:02:05.810
Yeah!

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:07.350
I can overlook stuff like this.

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:08.830
Aaaaaah!

00:02:08.890 --> 00:02:12.490
Rin Hyou Tou Sha Kai Jin Rei!
Rin

00:02:12.490 --> 00:02:12.670
Don't cast spells you don't even know!

00:02:12.670 --> 00:02:14.130
Owww!

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:15.930
Your fingers are all messed up now!

00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:19.830
No!

00:02:19.830 --> 00:02:21.990
There's no reason to run, Hiroshi.

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:26.700
I've come all this way to
deliver chocolate to you.

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:29.870
Now, battle me and try to take it from me.

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:30.950
There's no way!

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:33.380
You're on some level that no
human should try to pass!

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:36.470
Chocolate that my cute,
adorable daughter prepared...

00:02:36.470 --> 00:02:38.850
Hiro! Hiro!

00:02:38.850 --> 00:02:40.760
If you say that you don't
want it, I will kill you!

00:02:41.210 --> 00:02:42.760
If you want it, kill me!

00:02:43.070 --> 00:02:45.140
Someone'll die either way!

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:48.080
Calm down, Ogi-san!
It's just obligatory chocolate!

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:50.090
It's no more than a token of gratitude.

00:02:50.090 --> 00:02:50.800
Right?

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:56.980
She didn't make any for me...

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:02.770
Aaaaaah!

00:03:08.010 --> 00:03:09.710
This is nice, isn't it?

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:10.760
Enjoying...

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:12.500
...cocoa on the porch.

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:15.580
The mismatch of a Japanese
garden and cocoa will produce

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:17.300
a completely new taste, it will.

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:19.810
You should have some, too, Gabriella.

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:20.860
No, thanks.

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:22.240
Oh, don't be like that.

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:24.920
This will bring the
family closer together.

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:26.450
Slap!

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:28.940
Don't open the door without permission.
Do you want to get shot?

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:33.900
What's with all this chocolate?

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:38.380
In Japan, girls give boys they like
chocolate for Valentine's Day, they do.

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:39.800
What the hell?

00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:41.700
I don't understand Japanese men.

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:44.010
Do they like chocolate that much?

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:48.450
What we really want is the emotion.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:52.230
Even if it's obligatory,
that kindness makes a man feel at peace.

00:03:52.230 --> 00:03:55.760
There are no words for the pain of a
man who receives no chocolate.

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:58.500
I always spread kindness, as well.

00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:02.370
I always hit with a single shot
to the head or to the heart.

00:04:02.870 --> 00:04:06.430
That kindness may not
be felt by those living.

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:09.890
Well, enough of that.
I've got something interesting to show you.

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:13.150
The latest creation from our
family's medical department!

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:15.350
Chocolate with a love potion inside, it is!

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:16.740
Don!

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:18.790
Are you saying that there's someone you

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:18.810
want to use the love potion on?!

00:04:18.810 --> 00:04:20.570
Calm down, you love-obsessed fool!
want to use the love potion on?!

00:04:20.830 --> 00:04:22.820
This is still a prototype,
but once it's complete,

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:24.140
it will make us a lot of money, it will.

00:04:24.140 --> 00:04:27.280
We'll make the wolf eat it and
watch the results, we will.

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:29.300
You totally like the wolf!

00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:31.110
Please tell us the truth, Don!

00:04:31.110 --> 00:04:32.830
No! Do not misunderstand me!

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:34.620
I hate that wolf, I do!

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:35.550
Listen carefully.

00:04:35.550 --> 00:04:39.050
The heart of the one who eats
the dark chocolate will pound

00:04:39.050 --> 00:04:42.250
when he's near the one who
eats the white chocolate.

00:04:42.250 --> 00:04:44.070
However, the feelings of
the dark chocolate eater

00:04:44.070 --> 00:04:45.680
will be completely one-sided.

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:47.090
Meaning,

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:48.240
his love can be manipulated

00:04:48.240 --> 00:04:49.660
by the white chocolate eater.

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:52.570
We will have the wolf fall in love
and then destroy him by dumping him.

00:04:52.570 --> 00:04:56.350
Watching the wolf in agony over a broken
heart will be delightful, it will.

00:05:00.920 --> 00:05:02.920
What a terrible man.

00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:06.320
Even I'm taken aback at times
by the extent of the Don's evil.

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:10.030
Nothing less from the Don,
the man with endless ideas.

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:12.400
Lorenzo! Since you are a
man of a thousand bags,

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:14.710
I will leave it to you to deliver
the chocolate to the wolf.

00:05:15.970 --> 00:05:20.670
It appears the time has finally come for
me to steal the spot of the cross-dresser.

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:23.360
The only problem is the cop, it is.

00:05:23.360 --> 00:05:25.840
He always shows up when we
don't want him there, he does.

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:28.050
There isn't any time we want him there.

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:30.460
I will take care of that cop myself.

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:32.780
I have my pride as an assassin.

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:34.830
I will kill anyone.

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:34.860
Clap
I will kill anyone.

00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:36.060
Clap

00:05:36.430 --> 00:05:40.350
And if the minion is watching,
I will kill him mercifully.

00:05:40.350 --> 00:05:43.280
This is what I mean by your kindness
being hard to comprehend.

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:45.350
Now, let us go!

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:46.160
Yes!

00:05:56.530 --> 00:05:57.390
How?!

00:05:57.390 --> 00:05:58.410
We run and run,

00:05:58.410 --> 00:06:00.220
but we're getting no distance
on Ogi-san who's walking!

00:06:00.220 --> 00:06:03.050
Could that be a mirage?!

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:05.680
There's a monster in the Tokyo desert.

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:10.720
Mr. Wolf, please accept this chocolate.

00:06:14.370 --> 00:06:16.990
Kei, I know she had a wig on,
but you just kicked a woman...

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:18.810
How could you not tell
who that was, Inaba-san?!

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:20.770
Exactly how do you usually
identify Lorenzo?!

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:23.770
To think he was able to see through
Lorenzo's disguise in an instant...

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:25.420
I want him even more now!

00:06:25.420 --> 00:06:26.570
Streaked Hair!

00:06:26.680 --> 00:06:27.610
Take this!

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:37.000
Thank you, thank you just
this once, goddess of war.

00:06:37.310 --> 00:06:39.030
You have saved us, Lady Streaked Hair.

00:06:39.030 --> 00:06:39.860
What the hell?

00:06:39.860 --> 00:06:41.830
I don't mind the groveling,
but don't touch me.

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:46.320
Azusa's... chocolates...

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:47.510
Bye-bye.
Azusa's... chocolates...

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:47.920
Bye-bye.

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:50.970
What? He's alive?!

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:52.360
Who are you...

00:06:52.880 --> 00:06:54.980
The bazooka out of nowhere
was a bit much, huh?

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:56.020
Do it! Do it!

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:57.800
You should totally arrest
that Streaked Hair.

00:06:57.800 --> 00:06:59.020
You switch sides so easily!

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:01.980
It's almost admirable to be able
to throw away your pride so easily.

00:07:02.950 --> 00:07:05.480
Stay back.
If you interfere, I'll kill you.

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:08.990
You're quite tough to be
able to withstand a bazooka.

00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:11.640
For that, I'll kill you mercifully.

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:13.170
Watch carefully, minion.

00:07:13.170 --> 00:07:14.400
Such a carefree declaration!

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:16.030
You like kind women, don't you?

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:19.330
Says the lady who just shot
a bazooka out of nowhere.

00:07:19.860 --> 00:07:22.520
She's facing them head on.
Let us assist her.

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:23.790
Wait, Lorenzo.

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:26.260
Gabriella is serious, she is.

00:07:26.260 --> 00:07:29.760
We shall believe in our family's
number one assassin, we shall.

00:07:33.250 --> 00:07:34.220
Damn it!

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:35.390
Hiroshi! Duck!

00:07:38.370 --> 00:07:38.930
Ogi-san!

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:43.350
Oh, but he's like an iron man. He'll be fine.

00:07:45.710 --> 00:07:49.280
Wh-What?! It actually worked! Why?!

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:52.910
S-Someone! Is there an engineer
among the doctors here?

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:56.140
It appears that you aren't completely iron.

00:07:56.140 --> 00:07:57.790
Good to know.

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:00.530
What are you doing?!
Get a hold of yourself, Ogi!

00:08:02.050 --> 00:08:02.930
Hiroshi...

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:07.630
Why?

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:08.870
That's a very good question.

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:12.530
When you told me to duck, this is
the result of you pushing me down.

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:14.700
Ogi!

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:16.840
Is it poison?

00:08:16.840 --> 00:08:17.660
Poison?!

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:21.700
Then, if he transforms and then bites
a white hair, he can heal him.

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:25.230
But we need Yuuta-kun to transform him...

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:25.580
There's no way
that he would
appear to save
Ogi.

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:28.570
There's no way that he
would appear to save Ogi.

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:29.890
Yuuta!

00:08:29.890 --> 00:08:31.700
Yuuta-kun! Please, come here!

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:32.080
Please help me!
So excited...

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:32.110
So excited...
Please help me!

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:33.650
Excited

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:36.050
Gabriella! What did you do to Ogi-san?!

00:08:36.050 --> 00:08:37.890
It's just a tranquilizer. He won't die.

00:08:37.970 --> 00:08:38.450
Damn

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:40.270
Just found Yuuta-kun.

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:43.910
Goat!

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:45.920
Get away! Get away!

00:08:46.680 --> 00:08:47.830
Eat it! Eat it!

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:48.590
Inaba-san!

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:54.040
What are you...

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:57.910
It is our family's special
dark chocolate, it is.

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:02.220
As soon as I eat this white chocolate,
you will be head over hee–

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:07.600
I've got horrible heartburn all of a sudden!
What the hell is this?!

00:09:08.010 --> 00:09:10.420
How dare you scare me?

00:09:10.660 --> 00:09:12.180
Wait, where's the white chocolate?

00:09:14.300 --> 00:09:15.430
Gulp.

00:09:17.150 --> 00:09:18.620
The love potion!

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:20.370
The love potion?!

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:23.050
What exactly are you doing, Don?

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:27.120
What the hell do you mean,
love potion? How stupid.

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:28.540
Are you all right, Inaba-san?

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:30.340
More importantly, are you all right?

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:31.110
In Love

00:09:31.110 --> 00:09:33.050
You have the eyes of a girl in love!

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:35.000
Don...

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:37.520
C-Calm down!

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:40.410
Kei, that talking goat is scary.

00:09:40.740 --> 00:09:41.970
Can I hold your hand?

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:43.720
What a stupid excuse to hold hands!

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:45.480
Not exactly how I planned it,

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:48.650
but the wolf's heart will
be broken nonetheless.

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:53.440
That sensible young man is
sure to reject that wolf.

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:55.380
Inaba-san, I'm really sorry, but...

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:55.780
What is it, meow?

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:56.700
Meow
What is it, meow?

00:10:01.140 --> 00:10:02.910
Nothing at all, meow.

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:06.870
There's a goat stabbing my head!

00:10:07.030 --> 00:10:08.910
You stupid cat lover!

00:10:09.860 --> 00:10:12.780
I'll be taking him. You can just die here.

00:10:12.780 --> 00:10:14.270
You want a piece of me, Streaked Hair?

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:15.980
We're transforming, Yuuta!

00:10:19.080 --> 00:10:20.090
Uh... Yuuta?

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:21.080
Rage
Uh... Yuuta?

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:21.890
Rage

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:23.240
It's written on his face!

00:10:23.240 --> 00:10:25.640
His rage is so considerately
written on his face!

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:26.140
Rage

00:10:32.280 --> 00:10:35.280
That level of power is not good, Yuuta...

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:38.160
You can't make your power-up so obvious...

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:40.970
You're fine as a dog. You're fine as a cat.

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:44.250
But how am I supposed to
fawn all over Sensei,

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:46.500
if he doesn't have a hair fetish?!

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:48.910
Exactly what were you fawning over?!

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:50.500
Hamu senryuu... ougi!
Hamu Senryuu

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:51.580
Hamu Senryuu
Hamu senryuu... ougi!

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:52.480
Hamu Senryuu Ougi
Hamu senryuu... ougi!

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:54.750
Hamu Senryuu Ougi

00:10:55.120 --> 00:10:57.010
Scorching Red Jealousy!

00:10:57.010 --> 00:10:58.530
Scorching Red Jealousy!!
Scorching Red Jealousy!

00:10:58.530 --> 00:11:00.970
Scorching Red Jealousy!!

00:11:01.190 --> 00:11:02.180
Look out!

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:04.360
KO Shield!

00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:09.020
Kuniharu Ogino!

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:14.110
Thank goodness there was an
ultimate shield laying around.

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:15.020
Are you hurt?

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:16.900
Inaba-san, calm down!

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:19.880
And don't be so wasteful
with the ultimate shield!

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:21.990
If this were an RPG,
it'd be a non-buyable item!

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:29.560
Secret Ougi: Scorching Red Jealousy!

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:34.250
"With my dad" version!

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:39.990
It was also the ultimate spear...

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:52.810
Why am I surrounded by charcoal?

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:55.160
We're getting rid of your old man scent.

00:11:55.160 --> 00:11:56.950
The power of charcoal is great.

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:02.260
Inaba-san, this...

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:04.200
Yesh, Kei?

00:12:04.550 --> 00:12:06.890
This is homemade chocolate
that Yuuta-kun made.

00:12:07.360 --> 00:12:09.200
Yay! Let's eat!

00:12:10.810 --> 00:12:13.680
You might want to have
forensics look at that first.

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:17.040
Munch, munch, munch...
Munch
Munch
Munch
Munch

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:17.750
Slurp...
Slurp...

00:12:17.750 --> 00:12:17.790
Slurp...

00:12:18.860 --> 00:12:21.300
Hair

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:23.220
Hair!

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:23.880
Hair
Hair!

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:24.800
Hair

00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:28.910
His love for hair returned,
and he turned back to normal.

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:31.360
Beware of Goats

00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:33.100
There's trouble!
Beware of Goats

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:34.900
There's trouble!

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:36.790
There's trouble, boss!

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:38.290
What's the matter, Oshichi?

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:39.480
So close! It's Hachi.

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:44.700
It appears that another
wolf is coming to Japan.

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:47.450
What?! Another Secret Doberman?!

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:49.540
I will not allow another wolf
to come to Japan, I will not!

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:50.620
Assassination confirmed!

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:53.080
Hello! Gabriella! There is
work for you, there is!

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:54.160
Shut up! I can hear you!

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:55.140
Is there a picture?

00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:55.870
Right here.

00:12:56.310 --> 00:12:59.800
She comes all the way from the Secret
Doberman Headquarters in France,

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:01.260
and her name is...

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:02.650
Stella.

00:13:09.880 --> 00:13:11.380
We can totally beat her, we can.

00:13:12.250 --> 00:13:12.720
The Wolf Girl
Assassination Case
Countermeasures
Headquarters

00:13:12.720 --> 00:13:16.600
Meeting Room
The Wolf Girl
Assassination Case
Countermeasures
Headquarters

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:18.560
Police
Headquarters

00:13:18.710 --> 00:13:21.640
Stel-la!

00:13:21.640 --> 00:13:22.360
Calm down.
Stel-la!

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:26.310
She's already naturally very timid.

00:13:26.310 --> 00:13:28.460
Don't make things worse
by trying to attack her.

00:13:28.460 --> 00:13:29.830
She's on high alert!

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:33.610
Defense Section Bodyguard, Ogata Yuzuki.

00:13:33.610 --> 00:13:36.580
I'm the SP that's been put
in charge of guarding you

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:38.830
and being your partner,
Secret Doberman Stella.

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:41.050
Here, shake hands.

00:13:44.210 --> 00:13:45.780
I'll protect you, Stella.

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:48.640
You don't have to be afraid of anything.

00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:51.550
I'm counting on you.
First, go to Chiba today—

00:13:51.550 --> 00:13:52.980
What are you talking about?

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:54.860
She has to greet her senpai first.

00:13:54.860 --> 00:13:56.230
We're going to Hiroshi's.

00:13:56.840 --> 00:13:58.650
We need to have a welcoming party for you.

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:00.400
Do you like cakes, Stella?

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:01.350
Yes!

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:01.900
Ogata!

00:14:03.630 --> 00:14:06.240
It's okay. I know that old man's scary.

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:09.870
Inaba
Detective
Agency

00:14:10.390 --> 00:14:11.830
Wow, she's so tiny.

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:13.850
She looks like she's trembling a bit.

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:16.790
It could be because we have her
surrounded in some odd formation.

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:18.750
Not a very brave dog, is she?

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:22.090
Kagome, kagome, bird in the cage...

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:24.810
Take this! The Japanese
game of Kagome Kagome!

00:14:24.810 --> 00:14:25.530
I wonder what kind of ritual
this looks like to a foreigner?

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:28.060
When will it come out?

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:30.220
All of your love is rather warped.
When will it come out?

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:30.580
When will it come out?

00:14:30.580 --> 00:14:32.600
So, why is Ogi all the way in the corner?

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:33.030
Alone

00:14:33.030 --> 00:14:35.180
Oh, because Stella's scared of him.
Alone

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:38.350
He's tall and pointy, but he's not scary.

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:40.350
He's my former partner.

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:46.490
Why aren't you friends anymore?

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:47.940
You don't like each other anymore?

00:14:49.350 --> 00:14:51.370
No, we're still friends.

00:14:51.840 --> 00:14:53.170
Adults have their reasons.

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:58.080
So, is Stella going to partner
up with you and go chase goats?

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:00.960
You'll probably forget all about me.

00:15:01.230 --> 00:15:02.580
She's partnering with Ogata.

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:05.220
Then I don't really care.

00:15:05.220 --> 00:15:07.090
Wow, such a peaceful expression.

00:15:07.320 --> 00:15:08.880
Hiroshi!

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:10.240
You're an SP, aren't you?

00:15:10.240 --> 00:15:11.810
Set your dog free already.

00:15:11.810 --> 00:15:13.010
Not a chance.

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:15.300
And it's because I'm an SP
that I'm a perfect match.

00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:17.780
A current SP with experience
in the investigation department.

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:23.310
Who else would be more suited to
nurturing a Secret Doberman?

00:15:23.850 --> 00:15:27.260
Not to mention, she totally loves me.

00:15:27.260 --> 00:15:30.010
You finally got a dog to like you, Ogata.

00:15:30.010 --> 00:15:31.280
Wonder how long that'll last.

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:33.610
I love Yuzuki! I recommend!

00:15:33.610 --> 00:15:35.160
You don't have to recommend anything.

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:37.450
For the sake of all dogs in
the world, keep him in line.

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:42.290
So they start working as
police dogs this young?

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:45.150
Nah. Even I was training
until I was thirteen.

00:15:45.470 --> 00:15:47.540
Stella is going to continue her
police dog training in Japan

00:15:47.540 --> 00:15:49.260
and become a Japanese police dog.

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:51.190
I'll work vewy hard!

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:55.890
Ogata-san is slowly losing his mind.

00:15:57.200 --> 00:15:59.220
Well, make sure you don't lose her.

00:15:59.550 --> 00:16:02.800
Don't worry. I'm not like Ogi.

00:16:03.160 --> 00:16:05.480
I won't let Stella run away from me.

00:16:05.800 --> 00:16:08.230
Hiroshi didn't run away from me...

00:16:08.640 --> 00:16:10.750
Today is Stella's welcoming party.

00:16:10.750 --> 00:16:12.910
I'll treat you guys to a delicious cake,
so you should come, too.

00:16:12.910 --> 00:16:13.650
Cake?!

00:16:13.650 --> 00:16:14.600
Treat?!

00:16:15.350 --> 00:16:16.950
And instantly, your popularity goes up.

00:16:17.180 --> 00:16:19.160
Cake! Cake!

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:19.660
Cake! Cake! Cake! Cake!

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:23.020
All right, follow Stella
for the cake parade!

00:16:23.020 --> 00:16:25.310
Cake! Cake! Cake! Cake!

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:26.700
Come on, you too, Ogi!

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:30.460
Cake! Cake! Cake! Cake!

00:16:38.920 --> 00:16:40.730
What am I going to do?
I don't know which one to get.

00:16:42.380 --> 00:16:43.780
Did you decide yet, Stella?

00:16:43.780 --> 00:16:44.960
The sun is going down soon.

00:16:47.220 --> 00:16:48.150
Just choose.

00:16:48.830 --> 00:16:50.300
It looks like it's going
to take a while longer.

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:52.110
Talk about carefree...

00:16:52.350 --> 00:16:56.300
Though it's only temporary,
she's got an SP guarding her.

00:16:56.770 --> 00:17:00.580
Sounds like a handful before
she's even acquired her skills.

00:17:01.210 --> 00:17:04.790
Well, two Secret Dobermans did quit.

00:17:05.350 --> 00:17:07.260
If something were to
happen to her now that

00:17:07.260 --> 00:17:08.630
France has entrusted her to us,

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:11.170
it could result in a secret investigation
of the Japanese police department.

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:14.680
It's true that Stella's ability to
gather data hasn't awakened yet,

00:17:15.280 --> 00:17:18.880
but there are mafias in Japan
that view wolves as enemies.

00:17:18.880 --> 00:17:23.480
So, apparently, the Secret Doberman
abilities aren't from birth?

00:17:23.800 --> 00:17:25.400
The data gathering ability is determined

00:17:25.400 --> 00:17:27.860
by the medium you gather it from first.

00:17:28.220 --> 00:17:29.730
Oh, really?

00:17:30.350 --> 00:17:32.360
Yeah, so the first time
is really important.

00:17:33.180 --> 00:17:35.680
The happy feeling that is felt by the brain

00:17:35.680 --> 00:17:37.250
when it gathers the
data is extremely high.

00:17:37.720 --> 00:17:40.500
The first medium I gathered
data from was hair,

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:42.370
so I happily became a hair fetishist.

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:44.120
However, if I had accidentally gathered

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:45.790
information initially from blood or flesh,

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:48.360
I would crave blood like
a vampire even if it meant

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:49.440
I would be committing crimes.

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:51.750
And they'd have had to get rid of me.

00:17:53.230 --> 00:17:54.080
Why are you crying?

00:17:54.700 --> 00:17:56.990
Because you said they'd get rid of you.

00:17:56.990 --> 00:17:58.890
You guys sound like you're having fun.

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:00.980
What a dangerous job.

00:18:00.980 --> 00:18:02.910
Make sure you don't get
a blood fetish, okay?

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:05.630
Thank you for waiting.

00:18:05.630 --> 00:18:07.100
Come on, let's eat cake.

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:10.810
Stella backup chop!

00:18:11.580 --> 00:18:12.440
What's wrong, Kei?

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:14.900
To think that you saw through
my pâtissier costume...

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:16.880
Logical people are incredible.

00:18:16.880 --> 00:18:19.070
It's incredible to think that
I wouldn't figure it out!

00:18:21.860 --> 00:18:22.950
They're trying to shut us in?

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:27.790
We have taken over this café, we have!

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:29.000
It's the goat!

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:30.710
As long as I am still alive,

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:33.130
I will not allow another
wolf to join, I will not!

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:33.880
Take this!

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:39.300
Die! Die! Die! Die!

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.130
Run! That pie is dangerous.

00:18:41.130 --> 00:18:42.760
He's pissed at the
addition of another wolf.

00:18:43.120 --> 00:18:44.750
They seriously appear anywhere.

00:18:44.750 --> 00:18:46.200
Everyone, take cover.

00:18:48.780 --> 00:18:49.270
Now!

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:52.300
They split us up.

00:18:52.300 --> 00:18:54.480
It'll be okay.
Ogi-san is on the other side.

00:18:58.220 --> 00:18:58.820
Idiot

00:18:58.820 --> 00:18:59.570
Scaredy Cat
Idiot

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:00.700
Commoner
Scaredy Cat
Idiot

00:19:00.830 --> 00:19:01.890
We're gonna die!

00:19:02.910 --> 00:19:04.300
Take care of Stella!

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:08.330
He's fast!

00:19:09.070 --> 00:19:11.170
So it was true that
he's Ogi-san's rival...

00:19:17.630 --> 00:19:18.560
Go to sleep!

00:19:21.240 --> 00:19:23.350
Senior Inspector

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:26.470
A dog policeman!
And he's a higher rank than me!

00:19:29.190 --> 00:19:31.510
Don't lose! You're our only offensive force!

00:19:31.510 --> 00:19:32.860
Damn it! How dare you?!

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:34.110
Take this!

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:37.320
Crap! My glasses are fogging up!

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:39.030
Like that matters!

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:41.160
A pro can just sense where you are!

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:43.530
Wow, I wonder what exactly she's sensing?

00:19:51.300 --> 00:19:52.160
Ogata-san!

00:19:53.050 --> 00:19:53.810
Are you all right?

00:19:53.810 --> 00:19:55.570
Yuzuki!

00:19:56.660 --> 00:19:58.150
I thought that was a direct hit.

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:01.800
The "Dogs of the World
Encyclopedia" saved my life.

00:20:03.510 --> 00:20:04.970
A 4D pocket!

00:20:06.190 --> 00:20:08.810
Now, now. Don't cry. I'm fine.

00:20:10.470 --> 00:20:12.000
I'll kill the goat.

00:20:19.460 --> 00:20:21.010
We are out of pies!

00:20:21.010 --> 00:20:22.150
All right, they're out of ammo!

00:20:22.410 --> 00:20:25.900
If we're out of pies, we shall throw cake.

00:20:25.900 --> 00:20:27.620
You're losing your sense of character...

00:20:28.670 --> 00:20:31.130
The assistant has eaten them all!

00:20:31.130 --> 00:20:32.940
Curses, you growing child!

00:20:32.940 --> 00:20:34.080
All right, let's do this.

00:20:38.020 --> 00:20:41.670
C-Could it be that Gabriella
was defeated...?

00:20:43.270 --> 00:20:44.380
I'm mad.

00:20:46.150 --> 00:20:47.280
I won't forgive you.

00:20:48.820 --> 00:20:49.800
I'll eat you!

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:52.600
Just you saying that is enough!

00:20:53.010 --> 00:20:53.980
Don't, Stella!

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:56.190
If you learn the taste of blood now,

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:57.510
they'll have to get rid of you!

00:20:58.070 --> 00:21:01.110
Not to mention, that goat
will definitely not be tasty!

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:02.990
Stretch!!

00:21:03.930 --> 00:21:06.150
Hooray for elasticity!

00:21:09.610 --> 00:21:11.360
That was way too close.

00:21:11.360 --> 00:21:12.620
Come on, Stella, heel.

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:15.350
Curse you, you violent wolf.

00:21:15.350 --> 00:21:17.040
You don't get it, do you, goat?

00:21:17.060 --> 00:21:17.330
Growl

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:20.530
She's a Secret Doberman from the
home of Secret Dobermans: France.
Growl

00:21:20.530 --> 00:21:23.050
If you can't beat me, you don't
stand a chance against her.
Growl

00:21:23.590 --> 00:21:26.550
If you're going to attack Stella,
try it after you beat me!

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:28.800
Creak, creak, creak

00:21:28.950 --> 00:21:31.520
You don't have to tell me!
I'll kill you first, I will!

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:33.640
Who cares about France?!

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:35.880
The "V" in Versailles
is the "V" in "veneer"!

00:21:35.880 --> 00:21:37.610
Might as well as be called
the Palace of Veneer!

00:21:37.610 --> 00:21:39.690
Power to the people!
Get outta here!

00:21:40.200 --> 00:21:41.140
Don't let them get away!

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:42.530
Oh.

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:46.450
Inaba
Detective
Agency

00:21:49.580 --> 00:21:51.500
Do you see something?

00:21:52.190 --> 00:21:55.540
It appears that since then,
Stella's become obsessed with elasticity.

00:23:26.810 --> 00:23:29.510
That was pretty funny.

00:23:29.510 --> 00:23:32.960
Damn. Now I'll have to
stay put until next week.

00:23:33.790 --> 00:23:36.380
We're about to move,
so we don't have a TV.

00:23:38.350 --> 00:23:40.860
What am I going to do about these feelings?!
